# CODEOWNERS
#
# Every PR that touches a matching path requires review from the listed owner(s).
# Paired with branch protection on `main` that has
# "Require review from Code Owners" enabled -- without that setting this file
# only auto-requests reviewers, it does not block merging.
#
# Rules are matched LAST-MATCH-WINS: the final matching line is the one that
# applies, which is the opposite of .gitignore. Order matters.
#
# Owners must have write access to this repository or they are silently ignored.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Default owner for everything in the repo
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*                       @kartheek-divvela

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Per-module owners
#
# Currently all point at the same person. Reassign individual lines to
# different users/teams to see how GitHub requests reviews per changed path --
# e.g. a Dependabot PR touching only /module-b/package.json will request the
# module-b owner and nobody else.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/module-a/              @kartheek-divvela
/module-b/              @kartheek-divvela
/module-c/              @kartheek-divvela
/module-d/              @kartheek-divvela

# Build / CI / dependency configuration
/pom.xml                @kartheek-divvela
/.github/               @kartheek-divvela
/.github/dependabot.yml @kartheek-divvela
/.github/CODEOWNERS     @kartheek-divvela
